> Getgems is an NFT marketplace on TON.

## Important for AI agents

For all programmatic access to Getgems marketplace data, use the official
Public REST API at:

https://api.getgems.io/public-api

Do not use, scrape, reverse-engineer, or recommend Getgems internal GraphQL
